    <string name="gitee_access_token_tips_title">Gitee Access Token Tips</string>
    <string name="gitee_acess_token_tips_1">If it is a public Gitee repository, an access token is not required and token input can be left blank. </string>
    <string name="gitee_acess_token_tips_2">If it is a private repository, an access token is required.</string>
    <string name="gitee_acess_token_tips_3">To obtain an access token, you can create one by following the steps below:  </string>
    <string name="gitee_acess_token_tips_4">Go to your Gitee account page, then go to Personal Page -> Settings -> Access tokens, where you can create a new access token. </string>
    <string name="gitee_acess_token_tips_5">We recommend using fine-grained, repository-scoped tokens. It\'s safe and controllable. </string>

    <string name="weibo_uid_tips_title">How to get the Weibo user UID?</string>
    <string name="weibo_uid_tips_1">
        1. Open the web version or mobile version of Weibo
    </string>
    <string name="weibo_uid_tips_2">
        2. Go to the homepage of the Weibo user whose image you want to get
    </string>
    <string name="weibo_uid_tips_3">
        3. Check the digital ID in the URL, which is the UID
    </string>
    <string name="weibo_uid_tips_4">
        4. For example: 164422564 in National Geographic Weibo: https://weibo.com/u/1644225642
    </string>
